   "source": "Logistic regression and LinearSVM both achieve F1 = 0.803 after tuning. Logistic regression is selected as the best model since it comes first in the search loop and ties are broken by order. It is also more interpretable than SVM.",
   "id": "f0ed765bcb0c9c58"
